{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/170566-token-walkamile-shoes","id":170566,"title":"Token: Walkamile Shoes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-16T04:55:54-07:00","id":170566,"title":"Token: Walkamile Shoes","content":"Walkamile Shoes (OO)<br /> <br /> When a mortal walks for over a mile in the Hedge, there is a slim chance their shoes will become Tokens. The more impractical the shoes are for long hikes the greater the odds. Walkamile Shoes have no supernatural effects when worn or possessed by their creator, save a Token's usual durability, but anyone else who wears the pair will physically transform into an exact double of the Token's creator; they become exactly as they were when they last wore the shoes. This effects both the Mein and the Mask.<br /> <br /> Catch: If the shoes are worn without proper payment then, whatever part of our life the creator dislikes, fate ensures that the wearer experiences it themselves. That is they experience the actual problems, not what the shoe's creators think of those problems. Wearing a paranoid man's shoes will cause people to treat you with the same suspicion that the shoes' owner elicits with his paranoid behaviour, but it won't create an elaborate conspiracy dedicated to your downfall or force you to feel fear at those stares.<br /> <br /> Drawback: Nobody else's shoes ever fit quite right. Anyone who wears Walkamile Shoes for more than a breif moment will find, when they take the shoes off, that they have developed some quite nasty blisters. Take a Condition that inflicts -3 to all athletics rolls that involve the feat, and -1 to all rolls while standing up. Magic cannot cure these blisters, but mundane medicine works as normal, naturally blisters heal if you wait a bit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 12-23-2014, 05:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-01T00:21:15-08:00","id":326701,"title":"","content":"So those shoes do not let you walk quicker, just experience the original wearers life?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-01T00:41:46-08:00","id":326713,"title":"","content":"Exactley..","